sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant Host as macOS host
  participant Work as kanna3-workd
  participant Mux as kanna3d
  participant Agent as The agent
  Person->>Host: pull task
  Host->>Work: work.task.pull
  Work->>Work: park prior task + set Desk task, one revision
  Work-->>Host: mutation reply, setup busy
  Work->>Mux: ensure desk window
  Work->>Work: ensure worktrees, move folder, register spec doc
  Work->>Mux: ensure and attach task layout, doc.open
  Work->>Mux: spawn agent before split, ratio 0.30
  Mux->>Agent: interactive login shell + adapter prompt file
  Work->>Work: doc.agent binds target
  Work->>Mux: gated kickoff message
  Work->>Mux: activate layout, finish setup
  Work-->>Host: events and task state
